        "node_id": "n_10_d15e76",
        "thought_text": "Instead of using Kruskal's algorithm to construct an MST, consider using Dijkstra's algorithm to determine the shortest paths and then iteratively removing the heaviest edges while maintaining connectivity and shortest path lengths.",
