        "node_id": "n_13_0427ad",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the edge addition process after constructing the MST. Instead of greedily adding the largest remaining edges, consider a priority queue that prioritizes edges which, when added, maximize the number of good vertices. This could involve a more sophisticated analysis of how each edge affects the shortest paths.",
